The game "Creepy Forest", which solves the mystery to the horror plot, will be launched globally on the Steam platform on Early 2023. Welcome to unveil the mysterious mountain forest;
You will manipulate the protagonist and uncover the long-standing horror story on the mountain;
The whole plot is mainly decrypted, the puzzle design is moderately difficult, and it is closely combined with the plot, bringing an immersive experience.

